<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
{{template "head" .Head}}
<body>
{{template "header" .}}
<main>
<h1>{{h .Head.Title}}</h1>
<p>Azure Pipelines tasks are retired on <time datetime="{{h .Cfg.RetirementDate}}">{{h .Cfg.RetirementDate}}</time> and removed on <time datetime="{{h .Cfg.RemovalDate}}">{{h .Cfg.RemovalDate}}</time>. Pipelines that still use a removed task fail. Find your task below and open its page for migration guidance.{{if .Cfg.ToolAvailable}} Install trasloco from the <a href="https://github.com/HarnageaGabriel/trasloco/releases/latest">latest release</a>, then run <code>trasloco modernize --check</code> to list every affected step in your repositories.{{end}}</p>
<p>Official source: <a href="{{h .Cfg.AnnouncementURL}}">Azure DevOps task retirement announcement</a>. Last verified: <time datetime="{{h .Cfg.Generated}}">{{h .Cfg.Generated}}</time>.</p>
<h2 id="classes">Tasks by kind of migration</h2>
<ul>
{{- range .Groups}}
<li><a href="#{{h .Slug}}">{{h .Label}}</a> ({{.Count}})</li>
{{- end}}
</ul>
<h2 id="all">All {{.Total}} tasks</h2>
<table>
<caption>Retired Azure Pipelines task versions, sorted by task name</caption>
<thead>
<tr><th scope="col">Task</th><th scope="col">Replacement</th><th scope="col">Kind of migration</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{{- range .Entries}}
<tr><th scope="row"><a href="{{h $.Base}}{{h .Path}}">{{h .Task}}</a></th><td>{{if and (eq .Class "D") .Replacement}}Closest task: {{h (join .Replacement ", ")}} (after migration){{else if .Replacement}}{{h (join .Replacement ", ")}}{{else}}none{{end}}</td><td>{{h .ClassLabel}}</td></tr>
{{- end}}
</tbody>
</table>
<h2 id="by-replacement">Grouped by replacement</h2>
{{- range .ReplacementGroups}}
<h3>Tasks replaced by <code>{{h .Replacement}}</code></h3>
<ul class="cols">
{{- range .Entries}}
<li><a href="{{h $.Base}}{{h .Path}}">{{h .Task}}</a></li>
{{- end}}
</ul>
{{- end}}
<h2 id="by-kind">Grouped by kind of migration</h2>
{{- range .Groups}}
<h3 id="{{h .Slug}}">{{h .Label}} ({{.Count}})</h3>
<ul class="cols">
{{- range .Entries}}
<li><a href="{{h $.Base}}{{h .Path}}">{{h .Task}}</a></li>
{{- end}}
</ul>
{{- end}}
<h2 id="faq">Questions</h2>
{{- range .FAQ}}
<h3>{{h .Question}}</h3>
<p>{{h .Answer}}</p>
{{- end}}
<h2 id="about">About trasloco</h2>
<p>trasloco is an open-source command-line tool that finds retired Azure Pipelines tasks. CI/CD pipeline migration is planned. This site is generated from its catalog. Machine-readable versions: <a href="{{h .Base}}/feed.xml">Atom feed</a>, <a href="{{h .Base}}/llms.txt">llms.txt</a>, <a href="{{h .Base}}/llms-full.txt">llms-full.txt</a> and <a href="{{h .Base}}/data/modernize.json">modernize.json</a>.</p>
</main>
{{template "footer" .}}
</body>
</html>
